// LosNinosDrums - drum kit for the "Los Ninos" demo preset (flat layout so the
// first-run seeding, which knows one folder level, can ship it).
//
// Synthesized from measurements of the record's percussion stem:
//   key 36  LosNinosKick.wav - sine sweep 105 -> 45 Hz over ~300 ms, full level
//           held ~90 ms (Synare-style electronic kick), pure sine (a saturated
//           first take buzzed "like a cajon" - maintainer's ear, 2026-08-29).
//   key 39  DoorSlam.wav - the backbeat "Tschak": gated noise burst, body
//           120-500 Hz (~180 ms), mid slap to ~100 ms, highs only a 20 ms clack,
//           plus a damped 190 Hz panel ping. A real hi-hat reads as wrong here.
// The rest are the top velocity layers of the SamsSonor kit, same GM notes:
// Sonor Force 3001 sampled by Sam Greene, mapped by kinwie - CC BY-SA 4.0
// (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
<group>
note_polyphony=1
<region> key=36 sample=LosNinosKick.wav
<region> key=35 sample=KickSonor.flac
<region> key=38 sample=SnareLH.flac
<region> key=39 sample=DoorSlam.wav
<region> key=43 sample=TomLow.flac

<group>
note_polyphony=2
<region> key=42 sample=HHClosed.flac group=1 off_by=1
<region> key=46 sample=HHOpen.flac group=2 off_by=1
